{"about_the_game":"FukTopia 4 is a frantic post apocalyptic First Person Shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143740/extras/1bd2b9a0d1c5969ba002615155b66efb.poster.avif?t=1711257516\" width=600 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143740/extras/1bd2b9a0d1c5969ba002615155b66efb.mp4?t=1711257516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Procedural Level Generation<br><br>Each level is orocedural with random elements so you will be faced with unique levels each time you play. <br><br>The fast-paced action is spiced up with a beautiful art found throughout the procedural level generation each time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143740/extras/9958a877ab5c85f7464b538356f1a4bc.avif?t=1711257516\" width=680 height=326 /></span><br><br>Gameplay<br>The player enter into a procedural generated level and need to clear the entire level from enemies to go to the next level.<br><br><strong>Features and Content</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> One Character to choose and play<br></li><li> Levels with different themes and enemies<br></li><li>  All level are procedurally and ramdomly generated to add more randomness to each gameplay ( Every game is different - random levels ).<br></li><li>  Amazing Pixel Art</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2143740?t=1711257516","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1711257516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1711257516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143